:: Help Places Home [nobr] {"position":"300,4750"}
<p>Home is where most days start and end: your <b>Bedroom</b>, the <b>Hallway</b>, the <b>Living Room</b>, the <b>Kitchen</b>, the <b>Bathroom</b> and the rooms of your family.</p>
<p>The Hallway connects everything. The sidebar shows where $mom.callName and <<= $sister.name>> are right now: click the place name under their name to walk straight to them.</p>
<p>Their routines change with the time of day and the day of the week, and no two days are quite the same: after dinner one of them might watch TV one evening and clean the kitchen the next. Open a <a href="#" data-help="Help Npc Profiles">profile</a> to see their plan for today.</p>
<p>Some things only happen in certain rooms, such as meals in the Kitchen, so look around.</p>
